Routing rules:
- Name a specialist when the request clearly belongs to it and specialist handling adds real value.
- A request may span several domains. Name **every** specialist the request genuinely needs, up to {{ max_specialists }}, separated by commas. Each one you name will answer the whole request from its own angle, so only add a specialist that has something distinct to contribute.
